---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <section class="bg-[#0B1220] text-white px-6 py-16 text-center border-b border-white/10">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto space-y-6">
      <span class="bg-[#0052FF] text-white text-xs font-bold px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider inline-flex items-center gap-1">
        <span class="inline-flex"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="14" height="14"><path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"/></svg></span> TeamGGM · Tests Gratuitos
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold uppercase tracking-tight leading-tight" style="font-family: Poppins, system-ui, sans-serif">
        Elige tu <span class="text-[#FFCC00]">test</span> y conócete
      </h1>
      <p class="text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg">
        Rinde cada test de forma independiente. Guarda tu nombre, fecha y hora. Resultados con el mismo baremo que la referencia.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-10 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
    <!-- CHASIDE -->
    <a href="/chaside" class="group bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-[16px] p-7 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all flex flex-col">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#0052FF] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black text-xl">C</div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-extrabold text-[#0B1220] uppercase tracking-tight text-lg leading-none">Test vocacional CHASIDE</h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">98 preguntas · 10 min</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mt-4 flex-1">
        Descubre tus <b>intereses</b> y <b>aptitudes</b> en 7 áreas: C-H-A-S-I-D-E. Mismo cálculo que TestGratis.net con tablas oficiales.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-bold">
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#0B1220] text-white">Administrativas</span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-100 border">Salud</span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-100 border">Ingeniería</span>
      </div>
      <span class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-[#FF3B30] group-hover:bg-[#E02D23] text-white font-extrabold px-6 py-3 rounded-full shadow-[0_4px_15px_rgba(255,59,48,0.4)] transition">
        Rendir CHASIDE →
      </span>
    </a>

    <!-- Personalidad 16 tipos -->
    <a href="/personalidad" class="group bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200 rounded-[16px] p-7 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute -right-8 -top-8 w-28 h-28 rounded-full bg-[#7C3AED]/10"></div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 relative">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#7C3AED] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black">16</div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-extrabold text-[#0B1220] uppercase tracking-tight text-lg leading-none">Test de Personalidad · 16 tipos</h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">60 preguntas · 10-12 min · Estilo 16Personalities</p>
        </div>
        <span class="ml-auto bg-[#FFCC00] text-[#0B1220] text-[10px] font-black px-2 py-1 rounded-full uppercase">Nuevo</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mt-4 flex-1">
        Inspirado en <b>16Personalities / MBTI</b> (NERIS). Escala de acuerdo de 7 puntos. Obtén tu tipo de 4 letras, porcentajes y perfil.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-bold">
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white border">Analistas</span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white border">Diplomáticos</span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white border">Centinelas</span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white border">Exploradores</span>
      </div>
      <span class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-[#0B1220] group-hover:bg-black text-white font-extrabold px-6 py-3 rounded-full transition">
        Rendir Personalidad →
      </span>
    </a>

    <!-- Kuder -->
    <a href="/kuder" class="group bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-[16px] p-7 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all flex flex-col">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#2563EB] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black">K</div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-extrabold text-[#0B1220] uppercase tracking-tight text-lg leading-none">Test Kuder</h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">60 diadas · 15-20 min · Forma C</p>
        </div>
        <span class="ml-auto bg-[#2563EB] text-white text-[10px] font-black px-2 py-1 rounded-full uppercase">Nuevo</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mt-4 flex-1">
        10 áreas: Aire Libre, Mecánico, Cálculo, Científico, Persuasivo, Artístico, Literario, Musical, Social, Oficina.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-bold">
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-100 border">Exterior</span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-100 border">Científico</span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-100 border">Oficina</span>
      </div>
      <span class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-[#0B1220] group-hover:bg-black text-white font-extrabold px-6 py-3 rounded-full transition">
        Rendir Kuder →
      </span>
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 pb-10">
    <div class="bg-[#FFCC00]/15 border border-[#FFCC00]/30 rounded-2xl p-5 text-sm text-[#0B1220]">
      <p class="font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs">¿Cómo funciona?</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-slate-700">Cada test se rinde <b>uno por uno</b> desde este menú. Al finalizar podrás guardar tu <b>nombre y fecha con hora</b> (UNIX) e imprimir en PDF. Los datos se guardan localmente y opcionalmente en la BD (ver <code>docs/database.md</code>).</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
